<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #4f46e5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { padding: 20px; background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; }
    .link { word-break: break-all; font-size: 12px; color: #4f46e5; }
    .footer { padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Reset your password</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi,</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset the HRMS password for <strong>{{email}}</strong>.</p>
      <p style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
        <a class="button" href="{{resetUrl}}">Choose a new password</a>
      </p>
      <p>If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:</p>
      <p class="link">{{resetUrl}}</p>
      <p>
        This link can be used once and expires in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes.
        Resetting your password signs you out of every other device.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email &mdash; your
        password has not been changed.
      </p>
      <p>Best regards,<br>HR Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated message from HRMS. Please do not reply.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
